      "type": "section",
      "position": 6,
      "data": {
        "title": "Quick Ratio: o teste rápido de saúde"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "6c2998f9-1afe-4f10-a36a-5dbb8b0a7d20",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "variant": "info",
            "title": "",
            "content": "Quick Ratio é o \"BMI do SaaS\" — número único que aponta saúde. Para early-stage (até $10k MRR) pode oscilar, mas após $50k MRR estabilize acima de 2 ou pause growth."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "004e7d74-8494-4709-a0dc-5078c718a572",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 7,
      "data": {
        "title": "Sinais antes do churn (leading indicators)"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "3873bf66-79f4-4b9f-9bf1-70bd8a184326",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Quando o cliente cancela, já é tarde. Churn é "
              },
              {
                "text": "lagging indicator",
                "italic": true
              },
              {
                "text": ". Leading indicators dão chance de intervir: "
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "528e251d-49df-4069-a265-fc0f633882d3",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "language": "sql",
            "code": "-- Identificar customers em risco\nSELECT\n  u.id,\n  u.email,\n  s.plan,\n  s.mrr,\n  MAX(e.created_at) AS last_event,\n  COUNT(DISTINCT DATE(e.created_at)) FILTER (\n    WHERE e.created_at > now() - interval '14 days'\n  ) AS active_days_14d,\n  COUNT(DISTINCT DATE(e.created_at)) FILTER (\n    WHERE e.created_at BETWEEN now() - interval '28 days' AND now() - interval '14 days'\n  ) AS active_days_prev_14d\nFROM users u\nJOIN subscriptions s ON s.user_id = u.id AND s.status = 'active'\nLEFT JOIN events e ON e.user_id = u.id\nGROUP BY u.id, u.email, s.plan, s.mrr\nHAVING\n  -- ativos antes, não agora\n  COUNT(DISTINCT DATE(e.created_at)) FILTER (WHERE e.created_at > now() - interval '14 days') < 3\n  AND COUNT(DISTINCT DATE(e.created_at)) FILTER (\n    WHERE e.created_at BETWEEN now() - interval '28 days' AND now() - interval '14 days'\n  ) >= 7\nORDER BY s.mrr DESC; -- prioriza customers de maior MRR"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
